dataSetInformation.common:generalComment:
The date was taken from the publication by the European Commission 2013 with the Best Available Techniques (BAT) for iron and steel production (Remus, 2013).
Specific input factors and specific emissions factors have been determined for sinter plants. These data show a significant number of sinter plants in Europe representing 91.13 million tonnes of sinter production in 2004. Other input data, which include water input and the input of compressed air, were collected from five sinter plants in Europe representing 52.6 million tonnes of sinter production in 1999. 

Air emissions are average values and relate to European plants after abatement for sinter production in the EU-25 in 2004.;
Synonyms: In UVEK2018 enthalten; 
